WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,020 --> 00:00:01,020
boss

2
00:00:01,020 --> 00:00:03,020
That sister has such cool hair

3
00:00:03,020 --> 00:00:10,680
The fish want it too

4
00:00:10,680 --> 00:00:17,940
Boss, give it a try

5
00:00:17,940 --> 00:00:18,940
I'll give you four thousand a month first

6
00:00:18,940 --> 00:00:19,940
We have a lot of life here

7
00:00:19,940 --> 00:00:20,970
In addition to making silverware

8
00:00:20,970 --> 00:00:22,970
When you are busy, you have to move some things

9
00:00:22,970 --> 00:00:27,890
If you can endure hardship, then leave me to do it

10
00:00:27,890 --> 00:00:28,890
No need to wait for tomorrow

11
00:00:28,890 --> 00:00:35,110
I can go to work now

12
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:37,370
Make a hundred bottles of juice today
